    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_20061205.0490\n\nDOHA, Dec 5 , 2006, 2006\n\nMiyashita of Japan wins men's 100m backstroke gold medal\n\n\n\n\nJunichi Miyashita of Japan won the men's 100m backstroke gold medal at the Asian Games here Tuesday in a time of 54.67.\n\nOuyang Kunpeng of China took the silver and Masafumi Yamaguchi of Japan won the bronze.",
